                <pb facs="0565" n="453" sameAs="frus:frus1910/pg453"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Minister Sherrill to
                        the Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Buenos
                                Aires</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1910-05-16"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">May 16,
                    1910</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Your May 15. Argentine minister for foreign affairs reciprocates your cordial
                    messages and agrees to publication of notes at respective capitals after
                    presentation.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sherrill.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
